meta {
  name: Submit Volunteer Feedback
  type: http
  seq: 7
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/volunteer/feedback
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "firstName": "Jane",
    "surname": "Doe",
    "programVolunteered": "ASH",
    "specificProgramDetails": "",
    "volunteerDuration": "3-6 MONTHS",
    "overallExperienceRating": 5,
    "roleClarityRating": 4,
    "teamSupportRating": 5,
    "organizationRating": 4,
    "programMadeImpact": "YES - VERY STRONG",
    "waysProgramHelped": ["IMPROVED ACADEMIC SUPPORT", "STUDENT CONFIDENCE"],
    "activitiesInvolvedIn": ["TEACHING / TUTORING", "MENTORING"],
    "skillsDeveloped": "YES",
    "skillsGained": ["TEACHING", "COMMUNICATION"],
    "enjoyedMost": "",
    "challengesExperienced": "",
    "improvementSuggestions": "",
    "continueVolunteering": "YES",
    "wouldRecommend": "YES",
    "additionalComments": "",
    "submissionDate": "2026-05-20"
  }
}

vars:pre-request {
  baseUrl: http://localhost:3000
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  # Submit Volunteer Feedback
  
  Submits an end-of-cycle feedback form from a volunteer. The form collects the volunteer's overall experience rating, programme impact assessment, activities participated in, skills gained, and suggestions for improvement.
  
  On success, the feedback record is stored in the database and the endpoint returns the newly created object with a `201 Created` status.
  
  ## Authorization
  No authentication is required for this endpoint (public form submission).
  
  ## Request Body (`application/json`)
  
  ### Volunteer Identity
  
  | Field     | Type   | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values |
  |-----------|--------|----------|------------------------------|
  | firstName | string | Yes      | Non-empty text               |
  | surname   | string | Yes      | Non-empty text               |
  
  ### Programme Details
  
  | Field                   | Type   | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values                                                                                  |
  |-------------------------|--------|----------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | programVolunteered      | string | Yes      | One of: `ASH`, `TACOTS SCHOLARSHIP`, `CAPACITY BUILDING`, `CEDAR OUTREACHES`                                 |
  | specificProgramDetails  | string | No       | Optional free text                                                                                            |
  | volunteerDuration       | string | No       | One of: `< 3 MONTHS`, `3-6 MONTHS`, `6 MONTHS-1 YEAR`, `> 1 YEAR` (optional)                                |
  
  ### Experience Ratings
  
  | Field                    | Type   | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values  |
  |--------------------------|--------|----------|-------------------------------|
  | overallExperienceRating  | number | Yes      | Integer from `1` to `5`       |
  | roleClarityRating        | number | Yes      | Integer from `1` to `5`       |
  | teamSupportRating        | number | Yes      | Integer from `1` to `5`       |
  | organizationRating       | number | Yes      | Integer from `1` to `5`       |
  
  ### Programme Impact
  
  | Field               | Type   | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values                                                                                               |
  |---------------------|--------|----------|----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | programMadeImpact   | string | No       | One of: `YES - VERY STRONG`, `YES - SOME`, `NOT SURE`, `NO` (optional)                                                    |
  | waysProgramHelped   | array  | No       | Array of: `IMPROVED ACADEMIC SUPPORT`, `STUDENT CONFIDENCE`, `MENTORSHIP`, `SKILLS DEVELOPMENT`, `UNDERSERVED COMMUNITIES` (optional) |
  | activitiesInvolvedIn | array | No       | Array of: `TEACHING / TUTORING`, `MENTORING`, `EXTRACURRICULAR`, `COMMUNITY OUTREACH`, `EVENT SUPPORT`, `COORDINATION`, `TRAINING`, `OTHER` (optional) |
  
  ### Skills & Personal Growth
  
  | Field           | Type   | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values                                                                                                   |
  |-----------------|--------|----------|--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | skillsDeveloped | string | No       | One of: `YES`, `SOMEWHAT`, `NO` (optional)                                                                                     |
  | skillsGained    | array  | No       | Array of: `TEACHING`, `COMMUNICATION`, `LEADERSHIP`, `MENTORSHIP`, `TEAMWORK`, `COMMUNITY ENGAGEMENT`, `FACILITATION` (optional) |
  
  ### Open Feedback
  
  | Field                     | Type   | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values         |
  |---------------------------|--------|----------|--------------------------------------|
  | enjoyedMost               | string | No       | Optional free text                   |
  | challengesExperienced     | string | No       | Optional free text                   |
  | improvementSuggestions    | string | No       | Optional free text                   |
  | continueVolunteering      | string | No       | One of: `YES`, `MAYBE`, `NO` (optional) |
  | wouldRecommend            | string | No       | One of: `YES`, `MAYBE`, `NO` (optional) |
  | additionalComments        | string | No       | Optional free text                   |
  | submissionDate            | date   | Yes      | ISO date string — `YYYY-MM-DD` format |
  
  ## Response
  
  **`201 Created`** — Returns the newly created volunteer feedback record.
  
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "...",
    "data": { ... },
    "meta": {
      "correlationId": "uuid-v4-string"
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ## Errors
  
  | Status                      | Description                                                                          |
  |-----------------------------|--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | `400 Bad Request`           | Validation failed — missing required fields or invalid enum values.                  |
  | `404 Not Found`             | No registered volunteer matches the provided `surname`.                              |
  | `429 Too Many Requests`     | Rate limit exceeded (`formUploadLimiter`: 3 requests per 15-minute window, keyed by IP). |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Unexpected server error.                                                             |
  
  ## Rate Limiting
  This endpoint is protected by `formUploadLimiter` — a maximum of **3 requests per 15-minute window**, keyed by the client's IP address. Exceeds return a `429` with `{ code: "RATE_LIMITED", message: "Too many submission attempts. Please try again later" }`.
}
